# Trigger either hand buzzer without changing either arm-restraint output.
# Served by: teensy node (firmware, service ~/set_buzzer) / mock_teensy node.
# Each accepted request produces a firmware-bounded one-second pulse.

# --- Request ---
bool left_arm   # True to pulse the left-hand buzzer
bool right_arm  # True to pulse the right-hand buzzer
---
# --- Response ---
bool success    # False when neither buzzer was selected
string message  # Human-readable confirmation or error
